     "citations": null,
     "text": "{\"related_campaigns\": [], \"kill_chain_stage\": \"initial access\", \"prior_alert_context\": \"This impossible travel anomaly (New York to Tokyo in 127 minutes) strongly suggests a compromised account (T1078 - Valid Accounts). Expect to see follow-up alerts on lateral movement using the same credentials to access sensitive systems, remote services logons (T1021), privilege escalation attempts, or data exfiltration. The brief time window between locations indicates either automated credential use or a highly coordinated attack. Monitor for correlated authentication events on this account across network resources, VPN access, cloud services, and sensitive applications.\", \"threat_severity_hint\": \"high\"}",
